# Web3Forms access key — powers the contact form (static, no backend needed).
# Get a free key in seconds at https://web3forms.com (free tier: 250 submissions/month, no paid account required).
# Copy this file to .env.local, paste your key below, then restart the dev server.
# Without a key, the form gracefully falls back to a "mailto" link.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
